<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  5.12%				    O/N = 8.52%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  5.12%				    T/N = 7.68%</p>
<p>		   Oct 7, 1996			Oct 4, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  7.03%	1 month forward =  7.72%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.62%	2 month forward =  6.97%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.06%	3 month forward =  7.52%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.85%	4 month forward =  8.28%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.19%	5 month forward =  8.60%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  8.38%	6 month forward =  8.75%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
